---
import Seo from '../components/Seo.astro';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <Seo title="About | WESTMONT Home & Interiors" description="The WESTMONT point of view: beautiful living within reach, thoughtful sourcing, and a home that feels personal." />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">SKIP TO CONTENT</a>
    <div class="announcement">THE ART OF LIVING BEAUTIFULLY, FOR LESS</div>
    <header class="header">
      <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Westmont homepage">WESTMONT<span>HOME & INTERIORS</span></a>
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="/#spaces">SPACES</a><a href="/blog/">THE JOURNAL</a><a href="/curated-finds/">CURATED FINDS</a><a href="/about/" aria-current="page">ABOUT</a></nav>
      <details class="mobile-menu"><summary aria-label="Open navigation"><span></span><span></span></summary><nav aria-label="Mobile navigation"><a href="/">HOME</a><a href="/#spaces">SPACES</a><a href="/blog/">THE JOURNAL</a><a href="/curated-finds/">CURATED FINDS</a><a href="/about/" aria-current="page">ABOUT</a></nav></details>
    </header>
    <script>
      const menu = document.querySelector<HTMLDetailsElement>('.mobile-menu');
      const toggle = menu?.querySelector('summary');
      if (menu && toggle) {
        menu.addEventListener('toggle', () => {
          toggle.setAttribute('aria-label', menu.open ? 'Close navigation' : 'Open navigation');
        });
        menu.querySelectorAll('a').forEach((link) => {
          link.addEventListener('click', () => { menu.open = false; });
        });
        document.addEventListener('click', (event) => {
          if (event.target instanceof Node && !menu.contains(event.target)) menu.open = false;
        });
        document.addEventListener('keydown', (event) => {
          if (event.key === 'Escape' && menu.open) {
            menu.open = false;
            toggle.focus();
          }
        });
        window.matchMedia('(max-width: 950px)').addEventListener('change', () => {
          menu.open = false;
        });
      }
    </script>
    <main id="main-content" class="about-page">
      <section class="journal-intro"><p class="eyebrow">THE WESTMONT POINT OF VIEW</p><h1>Beautiful living,<br /><em>within reach.</em></h1><p class="journal-description">A considered home. A little everyday luxury. A space that feels like you.</p></section>
      <section class="journal-feature" aria-labelledby="about-title">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600210492486-724fe5c67fb0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=85" alt="A warm living room with natural textures and thoughtfully layered furnishings" fetchpriority="high" />
        <div class="feature-copy"><p class="eyebrow">OUR PHILOSOPHY</p><h2 id="about-title">Luxury is<br /><em>a feeling.</em></h2><p>At WESTMONT, we believe a beautiful home is built through thoughtful choices. Warm textures, balanced proportions, and pieces with lasting appeal can make everyday spaces feel quietly special. Luxury within reach means finding that feeling at a price that makes sense for you.</p><p>Our approach to sourcing begins with how a piece belongs in a room: its shape, finish, texture, and usefulness. We look for finds that bring together style and value, with room for the things you already love. A home should grow over time, reflecting your life rather than a passing trend.</p></div>
      </section>
      <section class="about-reading"><p class="eyebrow">INSPIRATION, WITH INTENTION</p><h2>A more personal<br /><em>way to make a home.</em></h2><p>The Journal shares design ideas and the details that bring a room together. Curated Finds gathers pieces to help you put those ideas into practice. Both begin with the same question: what makes a space feel welcoming, considered, and your own?</p><p class="about-disclosure">Some links in Curated Finds are affiliate links. If you purchase through them, WESTMONT may earn a commission at no additional cost to you. We make that relationship clear so you can browse and choose with confidence.</p><div class="about-actions"><a class="button button-dark" href="/blog/">READ THE JOURNAL</a><a class="underlined-link" href="/curated-finds/">EXPLORE CURATED FINDS</a></div></section>
    </main>
    <footer><div class="footer-top"><a class="brand" href="/">WESTMONT<span>HOME & INTERIORS</span></a><p>Beautiful living, within reach.</p></div><div class="footer-bottom"><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} WESTMONT. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.</span><span>INTERIORS · INSPIRATION · INTENTION</span></div></footer>
  </body>
</html>
<style is:global>
:root{font-family:'DM Sans',Arial,sans-serif;color:#292d27;background:#f7f5f0}*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}img{display:block;width:100%;object-fit:cover}h1,h2,h3,p{margin-top:0}h1,h2,h3{font-weight:400}h1,h2,h3{font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif}em{font-weight:400}.announcement{background:#30372e;color:#f7f5f0;text-align:center;padding:12px;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.24em}.header{height:96px;padding:0 6%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px}.brand{display:inline-flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:27px;letter-spacing:.17em;white-space:nowrap;line-height:1}.brand span{font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.35em;margin-top:10px}.header nav{display:flex;gap:32px}.header nav a,.nav-end{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.13em;font-weight:600}.nav-end span{font-size:18px;margin-left:6px}.hero{height:700px;max-height:85vh;min-height:560px;display:flex;align-items:center;position:relative;color:white}.hero>img,.hero-overlay{position:absolute;inset:0;height:100%}.hero-overlay{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(19,23,19,.72),rgba(19,23,19,.13))}.hero-content{position:relative;margin-left:9%;max-width:760px}.eyebrow{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.23em;font-weight:700;color:#777f70;margin-bottom:22px}.light-text{color:#e5e8df}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(58px,7.5vw,112px);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin-bottom:26px}.hero-description{max-width:470px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#f0f0e9;margin-bottom:32px}.button{display:inline-flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:38px;padding:20px 26px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;font-weight:700}.button span{font-size:18px}.button-light{background:#f7f5f0;color:#292d27}.hero-caption{position:absolute;right:5%;bottom:32px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em}.intro{padding:115px 20px;text-align:center;max-width:920px;margin:auto}.intro h2,.section-heading h2,.newsletter h2{font-size:clamp(42px,5vw,72px);line-height:1.22;letter-spacing:-.035em}.intro h2{margin-bottom:26px}.intro>p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:630px;margin:0 auto 30px;color:#74796f;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9}.underlined-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:25px;border-bottom:1px solid;padding-bottom:10px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.12em;font-weight:700}.underlined-link span{font-size:18px}.section{padding:100px 6%;max-width:1500px;margin:auto}.section-heading{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:38px}.section-heading h2{margin-bottom:0}.side-label{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#8b9186;padding-bottom:10px}.room-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px}.room-image{overflow:hidden;aspect-ratio:3/4}.room-image img{height:100%;transition:transform .45s}.room-card:hover img{transform:scale(1.045)}.room-caption{color:#84897f;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;margin:20px 0 9px}.room-card h3{font-size:30px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.room-card h3 span{font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:22px}.statement{background:#30372e;color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:130px 20px}.statement h2{font-size:clamp(42px,5vw,74px);line-height:1.24;margin-bottom:28px}.statement>p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:540px;color:#d4d8cf;margin:0 auto 32px;line-height:1.9;font-size:15px}.button-outline{border:1px solid #dfe3db}.article-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:28px}.article-grid article>img{aspect-ratio:1.55;margin-bottom:26px}.article-grid .eyebrow{margin-bottom:14px}.article-grid h3{font-size:31px;margin-bottom:13px}.article-grid article>p:last-child{font-size:14px;color:#757a70;line-height:1.8}.newsletter{background:#e9e9e2;padding:90px 6%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:35px}.newsletter h2{margin-bottom:16px}.newsletter p:last-child{font-size:14px;color:#72786e;line-height:1.8}.button-dark{background:#30372e;color:white;white-space:nowrap}footer{padding:65px 6% 25px}.footer-top,.footer-bottom{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:25px}.footer-top p{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-style:italic;color:#777f72;font-size:20px}.footer-bottom{border-top:1px solid #ddd;margin-top:55px;padding-top:22px;color:#8b9086;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.14em}@media(max-width:950px){.header nav{display:none}.room-grid{gap:15px}}@media(max-width:650px){.header{height:78px}.brand{font-size:22px}.nav-end{font-size:9px}.hero{height:78vh;min-height:610px}.hero-content{margin:0 7%}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(52px,12vw,78px)}.hero-caption{font-size:8px}.intro{padding:85px 6%}.section{padding:75px 6%}.side-label{display:none}.room-grid,.article-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:30px}.room-image{aspect-ratio:4/4.3}.statement{padding:95px 7%}.newsletter{padding:75px 7%;display:block}.newsletter .button{margin-top:15px}.footer-top,.footer-bottom{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.footer-top p{margin-top:18px}.footer-bottom{line-height:1.8}}
</style>

<style is:global>
/* WESTMONT navigation: understated editorial styling */
.header nav a{position:relative;padding:12px 0;transition:color .2s ease}.header nav a::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:5px;left:0;width:0;height:1px;background:currentColor;transition:width .25s ease}.header nav a:hover::after,.header nav a:focus-visible::after{width:100%}.header nav a:hover{color:#777f70}.mobile-menu{display:none}.mobile-menu summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;padding:16px 8px;min-width:44px;min-height:44px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:6px}.mobile-menu summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.mobile-menu summary span{display:block;width:25px;height:1px;background:#292d27}.mobile-menu[open] summary span:first-child{transform:translateY(3.5px) rotate(45deg)}.mobile-menu[open] summary span:last-child{transform:translateY(-3.5px) rotate(-45deg)}@media(max-width:950px){.mobile-menu{display:block}.mobile-menu nav{display:none;position:absolute;z-index:50;top:100%;left:0;right:0;background:#f7f5f0;padding:30px 7% 44px;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;box-shadow:0 18px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.09)}.mobile-menu[open] nav{display:flex}.header{position:relative;z-index:20}.mobile-menu nav a{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.16em;padding:15px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e1d9}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.header nav a,.header nav a::after{transition:none}}
</style>

<style is:global>
.header nav a[aria-current="page"]::after{width:100%}
.journal-page{width:100%;max-width:none;padding:0;margin:0}.journal-intro{text-align:center;padding:86px 6% 72px}.journal-intro h1{font-size:clamp(68px,8vw,110px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin-bottom:26px}.journal-deck{font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-size:26px;margin-bottom:18px}.journal-description{max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;color:#74796f;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9}.journal-feature{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr;max-width:1320px;margin:0 auto 40px;padding:0 6%}.journal-feature>img{height:100%;min-height:490px;object-fit:cover}.feature-copy{background:#e9e9e2;padding:65px 12%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:center}.feature-copy h2{font-size:clamp(38px,4vw,60px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.035em;margin-bottom:24px}.feature-copy>p:not(.eyebrow){font-size:14px;color:#72786e;line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:26px}.journal-stories{max-width:1320px;margin:auto;padding:65px 6% 90px}.story-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:28px}.story img{aspect-ratio:4/5;object-fit:cover;margin-bottom:25px}.story .eyebrow{font-size:9px;margin-bottom:14px}.story h3{font-size:29px;line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:15px}.story p:not(.eyebrow){font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#74796f}.coming-soon{display:inline-block;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.18em;border-top:1px solid #d8dacf;padding-top:16px;margin-top:5px;color:#777f70}.story a:hover h3{color:#777f70}.journal-note{text-align:center;background:#30372e;color:#f7f5f0;padding:85px 7%}.journal-note h2{font-size:clamp(38px,5vw,62px);line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:20px}.journal-note>p:not(.eyebrow){color:#d4d8cf;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:30px}a:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #777f70;outline-offset:5px}@media(max-width:950px){.journal-feature{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.feature-copy{padding:40px 10%}.journal-feature>img{min-height:430px}.story-grid{gap:20px}.story h3{font-size:25px}}@media(max-width:650px){.journal-intro{padding:60px 7% 48px}.journal-deck{font-size:23px}.journal-feature{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:0 7%;margin-bottom:0}.journal-feature>img{min-height:0;height:auto;aspect-ratio:4/3}.feature-copy{padding:38px 9% 44px}.journal-stories{padding:55px 7% 65px}.story-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:42px}.story img{aspect-ratio:4/3}.story h3{font-size:30px}.journal-note{padding:65px 7%}}
</style>

<style is:global>
.about-reading{max-width:820px;padding:70px 6% 105px;margin:auto}.about-reading h2{font-size:clamp(38px,5vw,60px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.035em}.about-reading>p:not(.eyebrow){font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#72786e}.about-reading .about-disclosure{font-size:13px;border-top:1px solid #ddd;padding-top:24px;margin-top:30px}.about-actions{display:flex;gap:30px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:35px}@media(max-width:650px){.about-reading{padding:55px 7% 75px}.about-actions{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column;gap:25px}}
</style>

<style is:global>
.skip-link{position:fixed;top:8px;left:8px;z-index:100;background:#30372e;color:#f7f5f0;padding:16px;font-size:12px;transform:translateY(-180%)}.skip-link:focus{transform:none}a:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #777f70;outline-offset:5px}
</style>
